1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,278
The consequences arrived as a long list about the difference between a database and a memory.

2
00:00:05,278 --> 00:00:23,439
A camera in the corridor, a recording of a phone call, and an entry in the log: the extent of what the system kept was larger than its developers had realised, and the recovery of deleted files was easier than anyone wanted to admit.

3
00:00:23,439 --> 00:00:29,068
The creation of a new norm took a shelf, a locker, and a supervisor.

4
00:00:29,068 --> 00:00:36,627
“Adjust the layout, modify the form, and repeat the test,” the supervisor said.

5
00:00:36,627 --> 00:00:51,695
“A scratch on a disk is a hazard, not a highlight.” A mechanic with a brandy in his hand and a noisy variant of the old procedure on his desk: the same story in two forms.

6
00:00:51,695 --> 00:00:56,394
The fluctuation in the data was the contention of the whole week.

7
00:00:56,394 --> 00:01:08,257
A sip of whisky, a pear on the plate, and a video of a chemistry demonstration: the system had recorded all of it, and none of it had been declared.

8
00:01:08,257 --> 00:01:15,896
The microscope of the imaging unit could see an electron; it could not see the question.

9
00:01:15,896 --> 00:01:23,374
The reinforcement of the rule was, in the end, a matter of photography and petroleum.

10
00:01:23,374 --> 00:01:36,537
A recorder in the corner, a radar on the roof, and an up-to-date list of what was affordable: the group standardised the visible part and automated the invisible one.

11
00:01:36,537 --> 00:01:40,052
The exhaustion of the team was the price.

12
00:01:40,052 --> 00:01:48,050
An intruder had negated three weeks of work with one wrong file, and the group had to begin the period again.

13
00:01:48,050 --> 00:01:52,330
“More of the same will not do it,” Maya wrote.

14
00:01:52,330 --> 00:01:56,969
“We must do less, and do it long.”

15
00:01:56,969 --> 00:02:04,488
The power of the small decision, its ability to become a routine, was the lesson of the term.

16
00:02:04,488 --> 00:02:14,746
About the full report, the group had one line to add at the end: a difference is not a defect, and a defect is not a difference.

17
00:02:14,746 --> 00:02:25,574
A painting on the wall, a tip from the supervisor, and an adjustment of the recording standard: the group would standardize the visible part.

18
00:02:25,574 --> 00:02:36,217
The camera in the entry, the extent of the database, and the creation of a second recovery point all had to be reviewed before the period ended.

19
00:02:36,217 --> 00:02:45,586
In time, the country would get the development it was paying for, or it would get a smaller bill instead.
